Error [jet.BuiltinsOutsideCore]: `jet_builtins` is private to Core
  --> tests/ui/core_builtins_private.jet:2:14
    |
  2 | use builtin: jet_builtins
    |              ^^^^^^^^^^^^
 Why: `jet_builtins` is Core's one door to the operations, storage types and markers the compiler provides; only Core sources import it.
 Fix: Import the public Core module that wraps the operation.
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E1013
